<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Arms Warrior DPS Phase 3</h3>Emblems of Triumph will drop in ToGC, as well as being a reward for the Daily Heroic. You should <i>not</i> use them to buy the 232 "Emblem only" tier pieces - save your emblems to buy the 245 ones which require a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> as well, as this will be far better in the long term. Emblems are a lot rarer than desired in P3 of WotLK Classic, and saving as many as possible will help to get strong tier pieces faster, as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
