<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 3</h3>Our best item for this slot in P3 is our tier helm. Providing both a useful source of hit and allowing access to our powerful 2 and 4 piece set bonuses, Helmet is the weakest of our tier pieces in an ideal setup, but is still strong regardless. However, in a 2 set setup, which the majority of players will use, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49478/helmet-of-wrath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helmet of Wrath</span></a> ends up pulling ahead, due to the increased ArP Budget.<br/>
<br/>If you can't access it early, which is likely due to the high badge requirement (or the difficulty of obtaining <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47558/regalia-of-the-grand-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Protector</span></a> for the upgraded version), then both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49478/helmet-of-wrath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helmet of Wrath</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47674/helm-of-thunderous-rampage">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Thunderous Rampage</span></a> are strong replacements, especially before you have other set items to enable the strong bonuses. If these are also unavailable to you, then you can fill in the gap with either the old <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45472/warhelm-of-the-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_134.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warhelm of the Champion</span></a>, or keep your T8 set bonuses with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46151/conquerors-siegebreaker-helmet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_58.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Siegebreaker Helmet</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44879/arcanum-of-torment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Torment</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
