<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 3</h3>This phase brings <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47545/vereesas-dexterity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vereesa's Dexterity</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47546/sylvanas-cunning">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sylvanas' Cunning</span></a>, depending on faction. While not the largest DPS increase on an item this tier (despite the very high ilvl on the cloak), the rarity and strength of this item make it a must grab for any Arms Warrior. This cloak will be used for the <i>entire game</i>, and is an incredibly strong item. It should be your highest priority in this phase to obtain this cloak.<br/>
<br/>In the interim, the 258 version of the cloak from 10M ToGC can serve as a replacement, or you can keep your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46032/drape-of-the-faceless-general">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Faceless General</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60663/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a>
